text @[Tomoya]
text I'll buy bread buns or something.
text @[Tomoya]
text So eat your whole lunch by yourself, all right?
text @[Tomoya]
text You'll get sick if you don't eat enough.
text She has that usual blank look on her face.
text It's as if she's letting each and every one of my words sink into her.
