text @[Kotomi]
text I'll be happy if you eat the lunch I make, too.
text She squints a bit and waits for my reaction.
text @[Tomoya]
text All right.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll share half of my buns with you.
sound BRW.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Halfsies...
