text "Day before yesterday I saw a rabbit...
sound BS0.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text ...and yesterday a deer, and today, you."
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
text I have no idea what she's talking about.
text Is that a line from a play or something?
text At the very least, I've never heard it before.
text @[Tomoya]
text What's that?
