text I hurry off.
text My footsteps echo in the empty hallway.
text The afternoon sun shines through the windows and shimmers on the floor as if I'm at the bottom of the ocean.
text I realize I had stopped in my tracks.
text @[Tomoya]
text Kotomi...-chan.
text I whisper to myself.
text Something is bothering me.
text A slight tinge of guilt in my heart that I can't shake off.
text It feels comfortable being here, but I still want to leave. That sort of feeling.
text I felt the same way when I first met her...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...?
text This huge question mark hovers over my head and I try to quickly shake it off.
text I don't have any more time to waste.
text I run faster.
