text ?
text @[Tomoya]
text I made a promise to eat lunch with someone else. I just happened to take some of yours today...
text @[Tomoya]
text I need to eat with that person again next week. So you don't need to leave anything for me.
text I tell her everything.
text I have to be blunt and stern about it, or she probably won't understand.
text She looks at me, confused.
text @[Tomoya]
text In other words, eat your whole lunch on your own.
text @[Tomoya]
text It'll be bad for your health if you don't eat enough.
